<sn><md>### The Complete Process

```text
Declaration
    ↓
int age;
    ↓
Initialization / Assignment
    ↓
age = 20;
```

Or both can happen simultaneously:

```c
int age = 20;
```

&gt; **In short:** Variable initialization is the process of `assigning an initial value to a variable` when it is declared.
